 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? The two most common methods are a split bill where each guest pays for themselves, and pooling everything and splitting the total evenly. Which feels right for your parents? That's nice of them. It takes the pressure off you and your partner. Not rude at all, it' a common offer. Most families just want to support the couple. Then it would come down to whether you want keep the split bill idea or pool everything and split the total. Good idea. Ask him to frame it as your idea.",
